Z||000004||Monkeyman||09-30-2001||05:55 PM||||I keep having this dream where there's this small patch of woods just beyond a little pond, down a hill from an old house, out in the middle of nowhere.  It's evening, but not quite dark yet.  The pond has a little wooden dock.  For some reason, I'm floating on my back in the pond.  I close my eyes for a moment and when I open them, there's some sort of creature staring me in the face.  I close my eyes again and gently slide under the water.  That's when I wake up.  I've had this dream off and on for close to 20 years.  Sometimes I'll have it every night for a month or more and other times I won't have it for months.  BTW--My entire dream (other than the part where I stare into the creatures eyes) is in the 3<sup>rd</sup> person.  Like I'm looking down the hill at myself.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Cooter||09-30-2001||05:59 PM||||I had this dream where I went to work, but nobody knew who I was. So I decided to take the day off. On the way out, I ran into my boss. He said "You look familiar". I said "Thanks, people say that a lot in these dreams."<BR>And then the horns kicked in, and my shoes started to squeak.<BR>Then I am walking down the beach in some tropical part of the world with this girl who talks with her eyes, and she says "Can you see what I am saying?"<BR>This is ponderous man, really ponderous.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Raydar||09-30-2001||10:34 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cooter:<BR><B>..."Can you see what I am saying?"<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I went to high school with a guy who said that on one occasion, that he could see the sound waves when people spoke. This was around 1971-1972. <BR>I know what some of you are thinking, and you are absolutely correct.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>A while back, I had a dream that I found the 85 GT that I used to own. Was in a garage under some woman's condo. Other than being covered in a bunch of dust, it was still perfect. And she was gonna let me have it for some ridiculously small amount of money. In the dream it was a T-top or targa. <P><BR>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||Fiero5||09-30-2001||10:46 PM||||I had a dream once that I was in a toy store, and they were having an awesome sale on Star Trek toys. I grabbed two of everything and went out thru the checkouts. Then I tried to figure out where I was going to put it all in my Fiero. As I was loading it up, I woke up.<BR>I looked around in my room, and as I feared, non of that awesome stuff made it back out of the dream with me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon8.gif"> <P>Steve||||reg||12
Z||000008||broys||10-01-2001||05:44 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero5:<BR><B>I had a dream once that I was in a toy store, and they were having an awesome sale on Star Trek toys. I grabbed two of everything and went out thru the checkouts. Then I tried to figure out where I was going to put it all in my Fiero. As I was loading it up, I woke up.<BR>I looked around in my room, and as I feared, non of that awesome stuff made it back out of the dream with me   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon8.gif">  <P>Steve</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You like star trek toys eh? You should see my collection from when I used to collect all that stuff. One of the toys I have is from the early 70s and is worth a few hundred bucks by now.<P>The other day I had a horrible horrible nightmare. I dreamed I was driving to school in a 94 geo tracker and it was a monday which meant I had to go to one of my most boring classes this quarter. Soon as I got to school though I woke up. Then I got ready for school and left...in a geo tracker, and it was monday. MY LIFE IS A LIVING NIGHTMARE. lol<P>Only on mondays though. :P||||reg||1
