Z||000012||GarethWright||10-02-2001||01:03 AM||||I had a dream, in which I was wearing a lizard costume and night vision goggles, because its very dark, I was climbing up a huge smooth, brick wall with 2 other people in lizard costumes, when I got to the top of the wall, we run along the top for a while until we see a huge Washing Machine and Dryer on the other side, so we jump down to the top of them and bounce, and when we get back down from the bounce, the tops of the washer and dryer have opened up like a laptop and are displaying something, Im standing on the keyboard and the screen stretches up out of sight in front of me, one giant word appears on the screen, and before I can read it, I wake up.<BR>Think its trying to tell me something?<P>edited for typo's<p>[This message has been edited by GarethWright (edited 10-02-2001).]||||reg||1
